(5757757, 837837, 75618, '<td valign="top">This one stands out from all the cliche shots (and yes, that includes mine haha). The pp is top-notch. The pole looks like a dandelion! 9</td>', 'This one stands out from all the cliche shots (and yes, that includes mine haha). The pp is top-notch. The pole looks like a dandelion! 9', '2009-12-07 06:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
