(5758268, 837813, 28427, '<td valign="top">Nice approach of the subject. Changes with all the power towers, grids etc...<br/>Good job</td>', 'Nice approach of the subject. Changes with all the power towers, grids etc...Good job', '2009-12-07 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758271, 838021, 28427, '<td valign="top">First I wondered...than I realized it is the moon that is showing at the left :)</td>', 'First I wondered...than I realized it is the moon that is showing at the left :)', '2009-12-07 14:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758319, 838015, 103142, '<td valign="top">spectacular!</td>', 'spectacular!', '2009-12-07 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758422, 838015, 16488, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the simplicity of this image. Mourning doves in quiet reverie. Color of the sky is delightful.</td>', 'I enjoy the simplicity of this image. Mourning doves in quiet reverie. Color of the sky is delightful.', '2009-12-07 16:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758428, 838006, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky! I like the way the silhouetted tree line echoes the shapes in the clouds...juxtaposed with the serenity of the power lines, too! Nice.</td>', 'Wonderful sky! I like the way the silhouetted tree line echoes the shapes in the clouds...juxtaposed with the serenity of the power lines, too! Nice.', '2009-12-07 16:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758440, 838001, 16488, '<td valign="top">Who''d have thought there''d be 3 raptors in this powerline competition?! I like this one best. Crisp details. Nice color palette. I like the way the rusty bolts repeat the color of the bird. I wish I could see the completion of the loop of wire as it serves to balance the bird...and might help emphasize the subject of the lines.</td>', 'Who''d have thought there''d be 3 raptors in this powerline competition?! I like this one best. Crisp details. Nice color palette. I like the way the rusty bolts repeat the color of the bird. I wish I could see the completion of the loop of wire as it serves to balance the bird...and might help emphasize the subject of the lines.', '2009-12-07 16:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758449, 837782, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstraction. I don''t think the lamp post helps the composition. Don''t you wish you could have cloned out the "incidental" pole? Color is astonishing.</td>', 'Interesting abstraction. I don''t think the lamp post helps the composition. Don''t you wish you could have cloned out the "incidental" pole? Color is astonishing.', '2009-12-07 16:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758454, 837857, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. I think the barn became the subject here, though. Still that ornate bracket with it''s lonely bulb...nostalgic.</td>', 'Lovely image. I think the barn became the subject here, though. Still that ornate bracket with it''s lonely bulb...nostalgic.', '2009-12-07 16:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758459, 837957, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the delicate lines of the towers. The light is so expertly handled it''s hard not to love this image!</td>', 'I like the delicate lines of the towers. The light is so expertly handled it''s hard not to love this image!', '2009-12-07 16:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758476, 837731, 16488, '<td valign="top">The powerlines are a bit secondary in this image. But, still, they are integral. I like the graphic structure of the image. The blank sky provides an interesting canvas for all the zig-zags of the structure to the right and the herons. I know it might have been impossible to avoid but the glowing light of the pylons (lower left corner) competes for attention in the image. Looking forward to finding out where one finds so many herons hanging out.</td>', 'The powerlines are a bit secondary in this image. But, still, they are integral. I like the graphic structure of the image. The blank sky provides an interesting canvas for all the zig-zags of the structure to the right and the herons. I know it might have been impossible to avoid but the glowing light of the pylons (lower left corner) competes for attention in the image. Looking forward to finding out where one finds so many herons hanging out.', '2009-12-07 16:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758478, 837565, 16488, '<td valign="top">It had to be done and you were the only one to do it...and you did it well! I just laughed when I saw this image because I''ll never understand what compels children to fling perfectly fine shoes into the sky, out of reach, out of shame or spite or jealousy...?<br/> <br/>Fine graphic with perfect color palette. Great subject. Hope it all translates.</td>', 'It had to be done and you were the only one to do it...and you did it well! I just laughed when I saw this image because I''ll never understand what compels children to fling perfectly fine shoes into the sky, out of reach, out of shame or spite or jealousy...? Fine graphic with perfect color palette. Great subject. Hope it all translates.', '2009-12-07 16:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758481, 837852, 16488, '<td valign="top">Of the several similar shots I like this one best. I think you nailed the composition. Lining up the supports with the corners of the frame sets the rest into an interesting spiral of squares diminishing into the distance. I don''t know if you have to have stood under one of these to appreciate the dizzying kaleidoscope but I have and I do.</td>', 'Of the several similar shots I like this one best. I think you nailed the composition. Lining up the supports with the corners of the frame sets the rest into an interesting spiral of squares diminishing into the distance. I don''t know if you have to have stood under one of these to appreciate the dizzying kaleidoscope but I have and I do.', '2009-12-07 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758483, 837957, 103004, '<td valign="top">amazing!I like everything about this picture..10</td>', 'amazing!I like everything about this picture..10', '2009-12-07 16:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758486, 837764, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice tension. The tilt of the tower makes it feel like it''s pulling the clouds into the sky.</td>', 'Nice tension. The tilt of the tower makes it feel like it''s pulling the clouds into the sky.', '2009-12-07 16:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758492, 837945, 16488, '<td valign="top">Surreal. I don''t really get the title, though. Nicely bizarre landscape...the moon makes it even more so. By way of composition, I wish that moon were a bit more cozy with the wood poles to pull it off center some.</td>', 'Surreal. I don''t really get the title, though. Nicely bizarre landscape...the moon makes it even more so. By way of composition, I wish that moon were a bit more cozy with the wood poles to pull it off center some.', '2009-12-07 16:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758498, 837992, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great composition! The full moon made a timely appearance this week. This image would be a bit more handsome if the noise around the insulators and lines.</td>', 'Great composition! The full moon made a timely appearance this week. This image would be a bit more handsome if the noise around the insulators and lines.', '2009-12-07 16:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758500, 837816, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the way the pole becomes a tall face to me. (Transformer = nose) Kind of a serious fellow determined to do his job well. :-]</td>', 'I like the way the pole becomes a tall face to me. (Transformer = nose) Kind of a serious fellow determined to do his job well. :-]', '2009-12-07 16:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758502, 837947, 16488, '<td valign="top">Compelling urban abstraction.</td>', 'Compelling urban abstraction.', '2009-12-07 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758505, 837945, 27608, '<td valign="top">Interesting with the moon/sun in the background, but I find it really distracts from the powerlines.</td>', 'Interesting with the moon/sun in the background, but I find it really distracts from the powerlines.', '2009-12-07 16:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758506, 837768, 27608, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and framing, although a bit of an CCW rotation would have been nicer.  Not a fan of the border.</td>', 'Nice colours and framing, although a bit of an CCW rotation would have been nicer.  Not a fan of the border.', '2009-12-07 16:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758508, 837441, 27608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2009-12-07 16:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
