(5759137, 837857, 111808, '<td valign="top">The snowstorm and weathered barn give this a feeling of tranquility and peace. The tiny delicate snowflakes silently blanket the trappings of Man, changing the landscape to one of Nature. The delicate curved lightpole fixture with its sole bare bulb echoes this composition of purity in shapes. The tones of the trees echo the tones of the barn. The white sky tone echoes the snowy ground. Balanced, nuanced, a superb composition of disparate elements.</td>', 'The snowstorm and weathered barn give this a feeling of tranquility and peace. The tiny delicate snowflakes silently blanket the trappings of Man, changing the landscape to one of Nature. The delicate curved lightpole fixture with its sole bare bulb echoes this composition of purity in shapes. The tones of the trees echo the tones of the barn. The white sky tone echoes the snowy ground. Balanced, nuanced, a superb composition of disparate elements.', '2009-12-07 22:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
