(5763961, 838027, 2490, '<td valign="top">Mary, the CEO of Pacific Energy, was very tired after a long photo shoot.  Hours and hours of posing with the towers in the background, with all the accompanying buzzing and the eyeball rattling vibration had left her with very little energy.  So, while waiting for the photo crew to pack up, she rested her weary head against a gatepost, drearily gazing toward the office where she would have to catch up on paperwork tomorrow.  The photographer, of course, had not packed up ALL the cameras...</td>', 'Mary, the CEO of Pacific Energy, was very tired after a long photo shoot.  Hours and hours of posing with the towers in the background, with all the accompanying buzzing and the eyeball rattling vibration had left her with very little energy.  So, while waiting for the photo crew to pack up, she rested her weary head against a gatepost, drearily gazing toward the office where she would have to catch up on paperwork tomorrow.  The photographer, of course, had not packed up ALL the cameras...', '2009-12-11 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
