(5764558, 837783, 54645, '<td valign="top">Almost very good. I like the grain, some will find it heavy handed. I don''t like the halo around the pole, definitely kills the polish of the image. Through out a few pieces of sensor dust, and I can really get behind this image as finished. However, this is still a favorite of mine for the challenge.</td>', 'Almost very good. I like the grain, some will find it heavy handed. I don''t like the halo around the pole, definitely kills the polish of the image. Through out a few pieces of sensor dust, and I can really get behind this image as finished. However, this is still a favorite of mine for the challenge.', '2009-12-12 09:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764560, 837793, 54645, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate your desire for this choice of tone and it''s connection with electricity. &lt;I don''t like it, but who cares!&gt; Kudos for an aggressive entry.</td>', 'I can appreciate your desire for this choice of tone and it''s connection with electricity. <I don''t like it, but who cares!> Kudos for an aggressive entry.', '2009-12-12 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764561, 837664, 54645, '<td valign="top">Dig the car offset in the distance</td>', 'Dig the car offset in the distance', '2009-12-12 09:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764562, 838028, 54645, '<td valign="top">Clean and beautiful. Certainly demonstrating a modern tree branch.</td>', 'Clean and beautiful. Certainly demonstrating a modern tree branch.', '2009-12-12 09:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764563, 837794, 54645, '<td valign="top">Contrasting size of the tower and tree make a strong statement. Well done.</td>', 'Contrasting size of the tower and tree make a strong statement. Well done.', '2009-12-12 09:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764566, 837299, 54645, '<td valign="top">Another heavy handed image. I like it. Your choice of processing contrasts a modern landscape with nature. Interesting that the sun is nearly obscured by the "structural pollution"! ;) I don''t get the inclusion of the speed limit sign, but I''ll survive. 7</td>', 'Another heavy handed image. I like it. Your choice of processing contrasts a modern landscape with nature. Interesting that the sun is nearly obscured by the "structural pollution"! ;) I don''t get the inclusion of the speed limit sign, but I''ll survive. 7', '2009-12-12 09:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764567, 837817, 54645, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable seen, huge crop?</td>', 'Enjoyable seen, huge crop?', '2009-12-12 09:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764568, 837761, 54645, '<td valign="top">interesting processing.</td>', 'interesting processing.', '2009-12-12 09:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764570, 838036, 54645, '<td valign="top">Filthadelphia? 9</td>', 'Filthadelphia? 9', '2009-12-12 09:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764633, 837957, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the person in the pic.  It gives the picture depth and balances the picture. IMO.  The tones are nice too.  I like your decision to shoot into the sun; it keeps everything in silhouette.  For a subject matter of "powerlines", this is presented very well.</td>', 'I like the composition with the person in the pic.  It gives the picture depth and balances the picture. IMO.  The tones are nice too.  I like your decision to shoot into the sun; it keeps everything in silhouette.  For a subject matter of "powerlines", this is presented very well.', '2009-12-12 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764635, 837731, 103032, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing, has a drawing quality.  Like the composition of the overpass (?) and the powerlines passing diagonally through the frame, and balanced on each side (by the pylon and another structure).</td>', 'Interesting processing, has a drawing quality.  Like the composition of the overpass (?) and the powerlines passing diagonally through the frame, and balanced on each side (by the pylon and another structure).', '2009-12-12 11:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764639, 838036, 103032, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice find.  The power lines fit really well in this context of the entire image.  I like your choice to go B&amp;W.  Well done.</td>', 'I think this is a nice find.  The power lines fit really well in this context of the entire image.  I like your choice to go B&W.  Well done.', '2009-12-12 12:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764644, 837968, 90495, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool image and one that''ll finish in the top 5 for sure.</td>', 'This is a very cool image and one that''ll finish in the top 5 for sure.', '2009-12-12 12:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764664, 837957, 47249, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I bet it gets a ribbon. My favourite anyway. 10</td>', 'Excellent! I bet it gets a ribbon. My favourite anyway. 10', '2009-12-12 12:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764665, 837815, 47249, '<td valign="top">Love this one! Different composition and effective blur b/w. 9</td>', 'Love this one! Different composition and effective blur b/w. 9', '2009-12-12 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5764667, 837837, 47249, '<td valign="top">Great impact! Among my three favourite for the ribbons. 9</td>', 'Great impact! Among my three favourite for the ribbons. 9', '2009-12-12 13:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
