(5765002, 837859, 83845, '<td valign="top">I like the lines and the colors.</td>', 'I like the lines and the colors.', '2009-12-12 22:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765111, 837761, 90495, '<td valign="top">...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-15 08:33:10.</i></td>', '...', '2009-12-13 01:54:22.000000', '2010-01-15 08:33:10.000000', 1),
(5765112, 837764, 90495, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.</td>', 'I like the perspective.', '2009-12-13 01:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765251, 837769, 104849, '<td valign="top">A very different perspective. I like it! It could have been even better without the runner...</td>', 'A very different perspective. I like it! It could have been even better without the runner...', '2009-12-13 09:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765378, 837977, 83313, '<td valign="top">Effective combination of color and sepia. More of a nice landscape than a photo of powerlines, but there will be a lot of entries like this.</td>', 'Effective combination of color and sepia. More of a nice landscape than a photo of powerlines, but there will be a lot of entries like this.', '2009-12-13 12:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765380, 837817, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it, but if I can nitpick, some selective editing to eliminate the graininess in the sky could have helped a bit.</td>', 'I like it, but if I can nitpick, some selective editing to eliminate the graininess in the sky could have helped a bit.', '2009-12-13 13:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765382, 837761, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some pretty heavy halos around everything. A 72k file size tells me this is probably compression artifacts. Always use the least amount of JPG compression you can and still sneak in under the challenge limit. With a 300k file size limit, you could have easily avoided this.</td>', 'Some pretty heavy halos around everything. A 72k file size tells me this is probably compression artifacts. Always use the least amount of JPG compression you can and still sneak in under the challenge limit. With a 300k file size limit, you could have easily avoided this.', '2009-12-13 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765383, 837837, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now this looks cool. Love the centered view and the grain really enhances it. The most artistic entry I have run into in this challenge so far. Hope it does well for you, it deserves a high placement.</td>', 'Now this looks cool. Love the centered view and the grain really enhances it. The most artistic entry I have run into in this challenge so far. Hope it does well for you, it deserves a high placement.', '2009-12-13 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765387, 837675, 83313, '<td valign="top">The whole image appears very fuzzy and soft. Your file size of only 43k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.</td>', 'The whole image appears very fuzzy and soft. Your file size of only 43k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.', '2009-12-13 13:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765528, 837857, 42100, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene with the great textures of the old barn compliment so nicely with the falling snow.</td>', 'Beautiful scene with the great textures of the old barn compliment so nicely with the falling snow.', '2009-12-13 16:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765694, 837966, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a transmission tower for radio or cellphones, but I think it still meets the spirit of the challenge. The processing is quite different looking, but I think it works for this.</td>', 'Looks more like a transmission tower for radio or cellphones, but I think it still meets the spirit of the challenge. The processing is quite different looking, but I think it works for this.', '2009-12-13 18:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765698, 837664, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, but I have one major critique. I see lots of grainy compression artifacts, especially in the sky. There may be some extra compression in this image killing some clarity. There is also a bit of visible tilt, but not enough to be perceived as an intentional effect.</td>', 'I like the scene, but I have one major critique. I see lots of grainy compression artifacts, especially in the sky. There may be some extra compression in this image killing some clarity. There is also a bit of visible tilt, but not enough to be perceived as an intentional effect.', '2009-12-13 18:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765701, 838013, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the artificial lighting and the dusk sky. It works well together in this scene.</td>', 'Nice work on the artificial lighting and the dusk sky. It works well together in this scene.', '2009-12-13 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765704, 838021, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just coming off to me a bit dark and dull in tone, I''m afraid. If that is the moon in the upper left, my first impression was that it was a blob of sensor crud that you overlooked cloning out.</td>', 'Just coming off to me a bit dark and dull in tone, I''m afraid. If that is the moon in the upper left, my first impression was that it was a blob of sensor crud that you overlooked cloning out.', '2009-12-13 18:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765713, 837680, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off as just a good snapshot, I''m afraid. A very different viewpoint than most entries, however.</td>', 'Comes off as just a good snapshot, I''m afraid. A very different viewpoint than most entries, however.', '2009-12-13 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765717, 837783, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and visually strong. I am realizing from voting this challenge that with skies, one needs to either get them incredibly smooth and noise free, or enhance and use the grain to add mood.</td>', 'Simple and visually strong. I am realizing from voting this challenge that with skies, one needs to either get them incredibly smooth and noise free, or enhance and use the grain to add mood.', '2009-12-13 18:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765720, 837968, 83313, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been caring much for these direct from the bottom shots, but you managed to catch some great clouds behind this one. Certainly cranked up a bit, but for this one it works.</td>', 'I haven''t been caring much for these direct from the bottom shots, but you managed to catch some great clouds behind this one. Certainly cranked up a bit, but for this one it works.', '2009-12-13 18:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765726, 837947, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this, as well as the way you used the light pole to frame the buildings. The angle and low perspective of the shot suggests a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a>-style shooting from the hip.</td>', 'I like the composition on this, as well as the way you used the light pole to frame the buildings. The angle and low perspective of the shot suggests a  bvy-style shooting from the hip.', '2009-12-13 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765728, 837957, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll see this one near the top.</td>', 'I''ll see this one near the top.', '2009-12-13 18:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5765735, 837992, 83313, '<td valign="top">All the blocky artifacts are killing this, I''m afraid, but lot of zoom, high ISO and a tight crop were certainly needed to get this shot. The silhouettes remind me a little bit of <a href="//www.mst3k.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Mystery Science Theater 3000</a></td>', 'All the blocky artifacts are killing this, I''m afraid, but lot of zoom, high ISO and a tight crop were certainly needed to get this shot. The silhouettes remind me a little bit of Mystery Science Theater 3000', '2009-12-13 19:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
