(5766084, 838036, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot despite your heavy crop. The film-i-ness is fine. The exposure and BW and PP is really great. Not every photo should be as smooth as a baby''s bottom. WD on your unique photo, (not another pylon), hard work and effort and top10.<br/> <br/>PS: Not to be picky (or PC) but (there''s the but) it''s not a train, it''s a "passenger" locomotive. A train is a locomotive coupled with many waggons/passenger cars behind it and then it''s called a passenger train. I''m just a train nut is all. Sorry!</td>', 'Wonderful shot despite your heavy crop. The film-i-ness is fine. The exposure and BW and PP is really great. Not every photo should be as smooth as a baby''s bottom. WD on your unique photo, (not another pylon), hard work and effort and top10. PS: Not to be picky (or PC) but (there''s the but) it''s not a train, it''s a "passenger" locomotive. A train is a locomotive coupled with many waggons/passenger cars behind it and then it''s called a passenger train. I''m just a train nut is all. Sorry!', '2009-12-14 00:25:26.000000', NULL, 0),
