(5766388, 837813, 99411, '<td valign="top">I was expecting a wide standard deviation of scores with my literal interpretation of the challenge but 16 scores below 3 is somewhat crazy.  I appreciate the DNMC comments but, as per the challenge title and description are these not overhead power lines?<br/> <br/>Powerlines - make OVERHEAD POWER TRANSMISSION LINES or the EQUIPMENT to SUPPORT them the subject of your photograph <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the positive comments, but I guess it''s back to a boring formula shot for me this week!<br/></td>', 'I was expecting a wide standard deviation of scores with my literal interpretation of the challenge but 16 scores below 3 is somewhat crazy.  I appreciate the DNMC comments but, as per the challenge title and description are these not overhead power lines? Powerlines - make OVERHEAD POWER TRANSMISSION LINES or the EQUIPMENT to SUPPORT them the subject of your photograph  Thanks for all the positive comments, but I guess it''s back to a boring formula shot for me this week!', '2009-12-14 07:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
