(5766458, 837957, 79720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Louis...congratulations on a well-deserved ribbon, love the duotone processing and the sunburst. How you were able to keep the lines from going jagged after sharpening will forever be a mystery to me. Missed you at the Toronto GTG.<br/> <br/>edit: a ''b'' for an ''m''. Silly be me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-14 13:35:02.</i></td>', 'Beautiful shot, Louis...congratulations on a well-deserved ribbon, love the duotone processing and the sunburst. How you were able to keep the lines from going jagged after sharpening will forever be a mystery to me. Missed you at the Toronto GTG. edit: a ''b'' for an ''m''. Silly be me.', '2009-12-14 08:50:10.000000', '2009-12-14 13:35:02.000000', 0),
