(5767244, 837460, 53814, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the PH Blue. I''ve never seen birds photographed like this. Even after looking at the collection, I''m not convinced the objects at the top are birds. Maybe Pinnipeds. I suspect trickery.</td>', 'Congratulations on the PH Blue. I''ve never seen birds photographed like this. Even after looking at the collection, I''m not convinced the objects at the top are birds. Maybe Pinnipeds. I suspect trickery.', '2009-12-14 17:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
