(5767265, 837460, 53814, '<td valign="top">On second thought, I think they are insects. The bird on the lower left is a wonderful bit of misdirection and makes the capture even more amazing. Whatever it is, I wish I had taken it.</td>', 'On second thought, I think they are insects. The bird on the lower left is a wonderful bit of misdirection and makes the capture even more amazing. Whatever it is, I wish I had taken it.', '2009-12-14 18:14:29.000000', NULL, 0),
