(5767976, 837460, 68504, '<td valign="top">Blue and brown! Corner of my eye helicopters, powerlines indeed.  This is what is so intriguing about (digital) cameras - they pick up stuff way beyond our original intention: brilliant of you to reintend it. Also it is so strange how our military machines ressemble what we call the lower orders of bios ...</td>', 'Blue and brown! Corner of my eye helicopters, powerlines indeed.  This is what is so intriguing about (digital) cameras - they pick up stuff way beyond our original intention: brilliant of you to reintend it. Also it is so strange how our military machines ressemble what we call the lower orders of bios ...', '2009-12-15 14:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
