(5768077, 837855, 55822, '<td valign="top">This looks very close to some of my favorite skiing grounds here in Vermont. As I look at your photo, I''m constantly looking for lines I could ski. I love your processing on the shot, and I have seen how weather like this makes everything monochrome. Well done and very deserving of your ribbon.</td>', 'This looks very close to some of my favorite skiing grounds here in Vermont. As I look at your photo, I''m constantly looking for lines I could ski. I love your processing on the shot, and I have seen how weather like this makes everything monochrome. Well done and very deserving of your ribbon.', '2009-12-15 17:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
